{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_22E561F0","title":"Found 6 Tumblers","entry":"Dlg_22E561F0::entry","exit":"Dlg_22E561F0::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_8C1AECE9","articyId":"72057619807800411","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Holy Hyperspace, you found six of them. I can't fucking believe it. How'd you do it?","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Holy Hyperspace, you found six of them. I can't fucking believe it. How'd you do it?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":-700.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40517","byteOffset":29656344,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_2E4F3930","articyId":"72057619807800439","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Amazing. Really, I can't believe you found six of them. Do you know what this means? There's only one left! Somewhere in Nivalis is the last remaining style of k20 tumblers... Think about it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Amazing. Really, I can't believe you found six of them. Do you know what this means? There's only one left! Somewhere in Nivalis is the last remaining style of k20 tumblers... Think about it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":200.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28374","byteOffset":18617160,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_2FE7C2E9","articyId":"72057619807800453","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Very cool indeed. We have to find it. We are so close to meeting the ghost. Binary God! What are we gonna ask it? No, don't tell me. Just go find it! I have to think...","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Very cool indeed. We have to find it. We are so close to meeting the ghost. Binary God! What are we gonna ask it? No, don't tell me. Just go find it! I have to think...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":800.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44544","byteOffset":31181384,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_8F036BA5","articyId":"72057619807800461","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"Maybe when we finally find the last one, we can wander around Nivalis together. Would be cool to see the city, the actual city, rather than just trying to find stuff inside it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Maybe when we finally find the last one, we can wander around Nivalis together. Would be cool to see the city, the actual city, rather than just trying to find stuff inside it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":200.0,"y":75.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27069","byteOffset":18120112,"byteLength":520}},{"id":"DFr_3DB38314","articyId":"72057619807800482","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"What a good day. What a very good day.","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What a good day. What a very good day.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":825.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18294","byteOffset":14807768,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_C0324CF8","articyId":"72057619807800500","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mia Jay","text":"We're so close! Any luck with the last one?","speakerId":"Ntt_4D0C5046","textSource":"lo